      advanced: "In SPAdes' GFA the KC tag is the k-mer count of a segment and DP = KC / (segment length − k), the value in the contig names. Example from ARVA's synthetic genome (150 bp reads, k = 77): the chromosome's k-mer coverage of 13.4 corresponds to a read depth of about 13.4 × 150 / 74 ≈ 27.",
